      "index": "b2n",
      "fontSize": 25,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "登录\nGatewayController → GatewayService → UserController.login\n→ AuthService → UserRepository + SessionRepository\n\n结算 /checkouts\nGatewayService → U01 身份校验 → OrderController.order\n→ OrderService → ProductRepository（核价 / 扣库存）\n→ OrderRepository（写入订单）\n\n支付创建\nGatewayService → U01 → PaymentController.create\n→ PaymentService；未配置供应商时返回 503",
      "originalText": "登录\nGatewayController → GatewayService → UserController.login\n→ AuthService → UserRepository + SessionRepository\n\n结算 /checkouts\nGatewayService → U01 身份校验 → OrderController.order\n→ OrderService → ProductRepository（核价 / 扣库存）\n→ OrderRepository（写入订单）\n\n支付创建\nGatewayService → U01 → PaymentController.create\n→ PaymentService；未配置供应商时返回 503",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
